# Golden route inventory — every registered route and its middleware chain
# (outermost wrapper first). Regenerate after an INTENTIONAL route change:
#   UPDATE_GOLDEN=1 go test ./cmd/mailserverd/ -run TestRouteInventoryGolden
# and review the diff in the commit. See route_inventory_test.go.
